Ok, I came up with this simple one-liner by using bc to compare the values and shell do the rest:\
\
$ value=0.5\
$ [ $(bc <<< "$value - 0.8 > 0") -eq 1 ] && echo $(bc <<< "$value - 0.8") || echo 0.1\
0.1\
$ [ $(bc <<< "$value - 0.2 > 0") -eq 1 ] && echo $(bc <<< "$value - 0.2") || echo 0.1\
.3\
\
\
\
q\
exit
